# Internal working materials are excluded from public release exports.
# `git archive` (used by scripts/publish-release.*) strips these paths via
# export-ignore; the publish scripts hard-fail if they still show up.
# The "dir/" form prunes the whole subtree; "dir/**" also marks inner paths.
openspec/ export-ignore
openspec/** export-ignore
.cursor/ export-ignore
.cursor/** export-ignore
.kilo/ export-ignore
.kilo/** export-ignore
release-notes/ export-ignore
release-notes/** export-ignore
AGENTS.md export-ignore
